{
  "_readme": [
    "Which vendor prop backs each logical asset id. Consumed by extract-assets.py.",
    "",
    "`node` is the vendor mesh name minus its `nodeSuffix`. To find one:",
    "  python3 scripts/extract-assets.py --list nature Fir_Tree",
    "",
    "Packs are Poly Perfect and share a byte-identical PP_Color_Palette, so props",
    "from all three composite into one GLB with a single material and base-color texture.",
    "Meshes are authored in centimetres, so each pack carries a 0.01 scale. Props",
    "are re-anchored on extraction (centred in x/z, resting on y=0); `scale` and",
    "`sink` here override that per prop. Run the script to print measured metres.",
    "",
    "Credit (CC-BY): Low Poly Nature - Flying Islands / Low Poly Mining, Cave &",
    "Blacksmith Pack / Low Poly Lava World by Poly Perfect, via Sketchfab."
  ],

  "sourceRoot": "~/Documents/3Dassets",

